; Auto-start script for the WinUAE test machine.
;
; The HDF's User-Startup runs Work: run at boot, so one test cycle is: build on
; the host (which deploys into C:\temp\amiga_gta\work), then start WinUAE with
; -f <config>. Nothing inside the HDF image ever changes - it is mounted
; read-only, so it cannot.
;
; This file is the version-controlled template. tools/bin/deploy.sh copies it
; to the shared folder; edit it here, not there.
;
; Stack: libnix gives a CLI process 4 KB by default. That is nowhere near
; enough for a game that recurses through map and sprite loading; the OpenTTD
; and OpenXcom ports both needed 1 MB for the same reason.
;
; Change the last line to switch which build runs.
Stack 1000000
CD Work:
gta-aga >Work:gta.log
